{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18480","headline":"太原旅怀呈薛十八侍御齐十二奉礼 · 欧阳詹","name":"太原旅怀呈薛十八侍御齐十二奉礼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前来称英隽，有食主人鱼。\n後来曰贤才，又受主人车。\n伊予亦投刺，恩煦胡凋疎。\n既覩主人面，复见主人书。\n餬口百家周，赁庑三月余。\n眼见寒序臻，坐送秋光除。\n西日惄饥肠，北风疾絺裾。\n升堂有知音，此意当何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18480.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18480","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}